<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trade Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 84.66 to 6740.74.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.23 to 406.09.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.33.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1239 to 1156.</p>
<p>Volume was 496,352,420 compared with 526,421,770 on Tuesday.</p>
